          "postType": {
            "description": "Optional target format where applicable: 'post' (default feed post/carousel), 'reel' (Instagram or Facebook Reel; requires video), 'story' (Instagram or Facebook 24h Story; requires image or video), or 'shorts' (YouTube Shorts; vertical video under 60s). Ignored on platforms without format variants.",
